<section id="bbs011" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Image plus text split: a working title and a short paragraph on the left, one framed photograph on the right in a padded surface plate that keeps the theme's corner radius.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item colspan="35" vertical-align="center" id="V90KURIEyB"><h2>The second delivery day changed the week</h2><p>Regional accounts that took two deliveries a week ordered smaller quantities more often, held less stock, and stopped calling about shortages. Drivers finished routes earlier because each stop carried fewer pallets.</p><p>The change cost one additional van and paid for itself within the quarter.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="25" padding="0" id="Sm4qYKd9eF"><ai-image prompt="Image in this deck's authored imagery style" background="true" meta='{"width":2560,"height":1440}' /></grid-item></grid></section>